WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:07.470
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:15.300
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.120
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:26.280
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:33.180
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.160
And then the light
that floods down...

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.130
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:52.240
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:59.480
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:05.720
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:11.690
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:19.110
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:27.040
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:08.110
Autozam will get
the Pillar system of Cephiro.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:16.160
No!

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:17.200
What?

00:02:17.630 --> 00:02:19.570
Whose voice is that?

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:29.300
The Magic Knights and Aska of Fahren

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.020
W-What is that?

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:11.280
A dragon?

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:14.520
The one who shall become the
princess of Cephiro...

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:15.710
...is me.

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:24.890
I, Aska of Fahren, shall be the
princess of this country as of today!

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:29.600
Fahren?

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:34.270
It's one of the invading
countries that Clef mentioned.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:37.770
The Dome of Fahren.

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:49.550
Geo, it's the Dome,
Fahren's mobile fortress.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:52.890
I'm monitoring it right now.
What a huge dragon!

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:54.920
FTO...

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:55.960
Go.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:08.710
Umi!

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:09.840
Fuu!

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.010
We should get in the Rune-Gods now!

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:12.580
We should get in the Rune-Gods now!
Right!

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:13.310
Right!

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:15.150
Rayearth!

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.280
Selece!

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:17.440
Windam!

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:45.780
We've finally arrived, elder!

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:47.180
Yes!

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:49.080
So this is Cephiro?

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:51.950
Indeed, this land is Cephiro.

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:54.910
I did it! I did it! I did it!

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:57.460
Lady Aska, please watch yourself!

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:03.760
It was a long trip!
I thought we would never get here!

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:07.160
A-As I said earlier, Lady Aska...

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:11.640
...it is a long way to Cephiro
from our homeland of Fahren.

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:13.100
Silence!

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:20.410
Now that I'm here,
I've basically won the battle!

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.110
Right, Sang Yung?

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.610
This is Cephiro.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:28.550
And I am Aska,
the first princess of Fahren!

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:32.920
So I've basically won the battle!

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:35.350
Is that not right, Sang Yung?

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:41.070
Um, I am glad that you have
arrived in Cephiro, Lady Aska.

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:45.740
But why does that lead
to victory? I don't see the link...

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:53.450
There is no way I would lose
to someone from another country!

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:54.980
Uh, I see...

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:57.920
Do you not think so?

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:01.520
You are invincible, Lady Aska.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:06.530
That's right! I am invincible!

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.190
Lady Aska!

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:12.630
What?

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:15.600
Someone is headed this way.

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.270
Please have a look.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:31.950
W-What is this?

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:40.630
I believe it is something
from Autozam, a neighboring country.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:44.960
I can never discern your
thoughts by looking at you...

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:47.360
...but you really are intelligent!

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:49.030
Uh, I guess...

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:54.330
Autozam. That's the country
full of machines, right?

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:56.440
Lady Aska!

00:06:56.710 --> 00:07:03.280
I've asked you repeatedly to be sure
to study our neighboring countries!

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:07.620
The FTO is a well-known
weapon from Autozam.

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:12.010
It was described in the book from
which you were supposed to study!

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:14.250
This is this, and that is that!

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:21.900
W-What is this?

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:31.310
They look really strong...
and really cool!

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:33.480
I agree...

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:36.350
Sang Yung, do you know what this is?

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:37.680
N-No...

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:40.250
Not even Sang Yung knows...

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.180
I do not know either.

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:46.950
However, I believe it is from Cephiro.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.590
From Cephiro?

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:55.630
I have heard Cephiro has guardians
called the legendary Rune-Gods.

00:07:56.200 --> 00:08:01.610
Guardians that have protected
this land since the beginning of time.

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:06.410
Legendary... Rune-Gods.

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:32.260
H-How long is it?

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:36.570
So Fahren's battleship is
in the shape of a dragon?

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.260
That looks so cool!

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:52.050
I definitely will become
the Pillar of Cephiro!

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:56.260
If I become Cephiro's Pillar...

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:59.490
I can be a princess
and get those Rune-Gods!

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:02.130
They will all be mine!

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:10.440
But why is that F-something-or-other
from Autozam here in Cephiro?

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:14.010
Perhaps they have
the same objective as you?

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:15.050
What?

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:18.920
The people of Autozam
likely want to claim this land too...

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:21.510
...by becoming the Pillar of Cephiro.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:22.650
That's right.

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:27.960
If one becomes Cephiro's Pillar, there
is nothing one cannot do in this land.

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.090
I won't allow it!

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:35.170
I am going to become
the Pillar of Cephiro!

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:40.140
Sang Yung! Brush and paper!

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:41.330
R-Right!

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:46.510
Lady Aska, you can't possibly
be thinking of doing that...

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:53.080
Secret Spell of
Dragon Art Reincarnation!

00:09:58.060 --> 00:10:00.820
Lady Aska, you mustn't! Please stop!

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:02.450
You stay quiet!

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.460
What is that?

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:50.570
First a dragon
and now a dancing lion?

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:02.920
An illusion that only
the Fahren royal family can use...

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:06.420
Are you all right, Eagle?

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:07.460
Yes.

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:09.790
For now, I am all right.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:11.520
However...

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:14.290
I think it will be rather tough...

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.700
...for those lady Magic Knights.

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:46.660
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:52.670
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:02.470
W-What is that?

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:04.450
Is that thing alive?

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:09.510
I do not know,
but it does not seem friendly.

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:13.360
I don't think it's alive...

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:16.260
How can you tell?

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:17.690
Just a hunch...

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:21.390
...but it doesn't feel... warm.

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:37.540
I haven't used a large illusion spell
in a while, but it looks like it went well!

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:43.060
Lady Aska, what are you doing, using
such a high-level illusion right away?

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:45.680
It's all right because it worked!

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:49.230
You cannot be so rash all the time.

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:51.730
Sheesh! You are too annoying!

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.770
Just sit quietly and watch!

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:00.970
Go!

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:07.100
Umi! Fuu!

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:28.270
Hold on! This feels
more like a monster movie!

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:36.640
Water Dragon!

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:41.980
It's magic!

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:45.720
It's just like Umi's Water Dragon.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:48.510
That thing is made out of magic!

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:53.450
Hikaru!

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:06.400
Damn you!

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.070
Are you all right, Hikaru?

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:13.270
Yeah...

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.190
W-What is up with this?

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:22.960
It is coming toward us!

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:26.520
Winds of Protection!

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:36.870
It grew again!

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:39.830
How much bigger is it going to get?

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:55.890
Damn you...
Scurrying about like that!

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:22.070
What?

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:40.430
It disappeared...

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:42.930
What's going on?

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:44.940
I have no idea...

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:49.470
This is the first time
anyone's broken that spell!

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:54.640
The spell was not broken. I believe it
was because you attacked yourself.

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:56.050
Silence!

00:15:57.420 --> 00:15:59.850
We'll charge those
Rune-Gods with this Dome!

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:02.750
Lady Aska, I think
we should retreat for now...

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:06.420
The army from Autozam
and the Rune-Gods of Cephiro.

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:09.590
Dealing with both
simultaneously is difficult.

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:13.660
Why don't we retreat for now
and come up with a strategy?

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:15.760
Strategy?

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:18.610
Yes.

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:24.200
Oh, all right.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:26.650
Retreat for now!

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:46.620
Legendary Magic Knights...

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:49.000
Eagle!

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:53.200
I've recorded all
the data from this battle.

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:55.800
Well, I'll see you again.

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:01.640
Wait!

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:14.090
So the battle for Cephiro against these
other countries is really beginning.

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:18.190
Cephiro doesn't have
a Pillar right now.

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:21.530
This time, we really might die.

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:26.400
If we were to perish
in another world such as Cephiro...

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:29.410
...I do not know what
will happen to us in Tokyo.

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:32.500
But I believe we will not
return alive and well.

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:35.440
Even so...

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:37.350
I will fight!

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.080
You're right.

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:43.660
I don't know what we can do
even though we're Magic Knights...

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.890
But I'll fight as well.

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:51.590
In order to have no regrets
should we return to Tokyo...

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:53.600
...I will also fight.

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:55.860
Umi...

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:57.260
Fuu...

00:17:57.500 --> 00:17:59.440
Let's make a promise!

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:02.600
No matter what happens...

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:05.540
...we absolutely won't drift apart.

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:10.210
Just like how we became
Magic Knights together...

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:14.120
...we should fight
for our hearts together!

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:17.080
So that no one ends up missing...

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:20.750
So that the three of us
stay together until the end!

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:21.950
Right.

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:27.930
W-What is this?

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:37.500
Hikaru, you want
to be with those girls?

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:43.170
I'll grant that wish.

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:47.110
I'll keep you together...

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:51.590
...and kill you all.

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:01.100
What's wrong?

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:03.140
Is something the matter, Ms. Hikaru?

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:06.230
A dream?

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:18.950
It's nothing.

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:22.610
It was... nothing.

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:35.230
Thank goodness they're all right.

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:40.770
That's good, right, Mokona?

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:46.310
They sure kept me worried,
those little missies.

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:49.280
However, that dragon...

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:51.540
The Dome of Fahren.

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:54.620
Then someone from
the royal family is aboard.

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:56.250
Most likely.

00:19:56.360 --> 00:19:58.050
That illusion earlier...

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:01.590
Only the royal family of
Fahren can use those spells.

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:04.630
I've heard stories about them.

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:06.720
That Fahren's royal family...

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:11.360
...has somethin' like magic
that only they can use.

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:14.070
Autozam and Fahren...

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:17.500
They've already arrived in Cephiro.

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:20.470
What? What?

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:23.380
Hey, where did Lantis go?

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:25.840
Lantis!

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:27.450
Lantis!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:36.790
Hey, what part
of that fluffy body is Lantis?

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:43.130
Lantis doesn't have
such a dazed-looking face!

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:46.870
Jeez!

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:47.940
Lantis!

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:49.670
Lantis!

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:56.310
Lantis...

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:59.590
The younger brother
of High Priest Zagato.

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:05.150
Why did he return now, just as the
Pillar, Princess Emeraude, was lost?

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:29.140
Zagato...

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:32.350
And Princess Emeraude...

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:47.290
Tragedy should never be repeated.

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:50.940
I will end with my own hands...

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:53.840
...the legend of the Magic Knights.

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:23.370
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:31.310
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:38.310
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:42.820
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:43.190 --> 00:22:45.560
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:47.390 --> 00:22:50.690
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:51.060 --> 00:22:54.400
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:54.840 --> 00:23:01.740
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:23:02.180 --> 00:23:05.580
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.910 --> 00:23:14.340
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:17.190 --> 00:23:20.520
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:20.760 --> 00:23:28.830
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:30.900 --> 00:23:37.710
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:48.050
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:48.560 --> 00:23:53.190
The castle suddenly shook. Cephiro
was crumbling away once again.

00:23:53.730 --> 00:23:57.160
At this rate,
this country really will disappear!

00:23:57.530 --> 00:24:00.830
Is finding a Pillar
to prevent this all that's left?

00:24:01.600 --> 00:24:04.970
Clef's going to tell us
a secret about the Pillar?

00:24:05.070 --> 00:24:06.870
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:07.170 --> 00:24:09.440
The Secret of the Pillar of Cephiro.

00:24:09.440 --> 00:24:10.110
The Secret of the Pillar of Cephiro
The Secret of the Pillar of Cephiro.

00:24:10.110 --> 00:24:12.180
The Secret of the Pillar of Cephiro
You have to watch it!

00:24:12.180 --> 00:24:13.450
The Secret of the Pillar of Cephiro

00:24:13.450 --> 00:24:20.320
Who is it today?

00:24:21.350 --> 00:24:23.350
Today, it's Mokona!

00:24:23.460 --> 00:24:29.420
Look forward to the next episode!
